sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Student
    participant B as B Parking Owner
    participant U as Shared UnitOfWork
    participant C as C Charging Owner
    participant DB as SQLite
    User->>B: confirm parking with charging(intentId)
    B->>U: executeAtomic(bundle booking)
    U->>DB: BEGIN IMMEDIATE
    U->>B: recheck parking right and capacity
    B-->>U: available or conflict
    alt parking and charger eligible
        U->>C: reserveBundlePort(bundleId,rightId,portId,range,context)
        C-->>U: BOOKED session or error
        alt all committed
            U->>DB: COMMIT right + port + intent receipt
            U-->>B: one CONFIRMED result
        else any precondition fails
            U->>DB: ROLLBACK
            U-->>B: no half bundle
        end
    else unavailable
        U->>DB: ROLLBACK
        U-->>B: rejected or conflict
    end
    B-->>User: final result or pending, same intent on retry
